      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To start, you need to identify the requirements for your trip."
      ],
      "justification": "The opening clause signals the temporal trigger for process initiation."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n3",
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If you choose \"Select one way\", you can proceed with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "The conditional introduces the XOR branch, the guard captures the 'one way' selection value, and the action reflects executing that path."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n4",
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if you choose \"Select return\", you can also continue with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the alternative conditional guard and the corresponding 'return' action step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5",
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After that, you will need to select the departure city and then the destination city."
      ],
      "justification": "The phrase 'After that' implies the prior choice paths have rejoined (converge), immediately followed by the two sequential city selection actions."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once you have chosen the destination city, you can proceed to select the class."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly maps to the class selection instruction."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the class is selected, you can then choose your seat."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly maps to the seat selection instruction."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After selecting your seat, you will be prompted to enter the type and number of passengers."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly maps to the passenger information entry step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once you have entered this information, you can continue to the flight selection."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly maps to the flight selection step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Finally, once you have completed the flight selection, the process will come to an end."
      ],
      "justification": "Maps the final flight completion action and the explicit process termination statement."
    }
